  "importantDesignNotes": [
    "DirectionProvider supplies Base UI context only; host must set DOM dir separately; LTR/RTL validation is not full library internationalization.",
    "Bubble is a presentational message surface with seven variants; message-level alignment belongs on Message.",
    "Marker is inline conversation status/system note/labeled separator, not a generic colored dot.",
    "Message is a conversation row, not Toast; fixed source has align prop only, not assistant/user role prop.",
    "MessageScroller behaviors stay in @shadcn/react; preserve DOM log, keyboard reachable region, stable IDs, user scroll interruption, history prepend anchoring and inert jump button.",
    "Questionnaire is an incremental questionnaire form, not an exam system; preserve native ChoiceInput and single primitive-owned state rather than nesting another full Rain RadioCard/CheckboxCard input.",
    "Questionnaire navigation can render Rain Button, but styles/data-slot merge must be tested; reuse passive indicators and Input styles without duplicating input state.",
    "Existing motion package can provide optional opacity/transform entrances; no new motion, AI SDK, markdown, icon, virtualization, or shadcn CLI package needed.",
    "Same fixed Nova style uses some physical left/right positions for reactions, so translate to logical inset in Rain if RTL is supported."
  ],
